    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just cant do this anymore. i saw a thread today... people are still dissecting everything i ever said like it's some kind of crime scene. i cant even go to the grocery store without feeling like every single person in the aisle is judging me. i'm already dead to everyone anyway. it's like i'm a ghost walking around in a body that doesnt belong to me anymore.",
